Quick log on Android is one full-screen cover with the dock inline at the foot of its scroll view, sized as its detent would size it: a detented sheet over the cover is a second window that takes every tap. Off a sheet, presentationDetents swallows the dock, so the sheet modifiers stay iOS-only. DockClearance stays iOS-only: the inline dock already ends the cards above it

